      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALGORITHM (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 5th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (23.10) at Gawler. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from eight attempts. Can make amends. TODD'S LUKA (7) finds it hard to break through. Finished in the money last time though when second (20.10) at Angle Park. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Expected to be in the finish again. NIPPY ZESTA (5) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 455m behind Compton To Avoid (27.15) in a Grade 6. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. WEBLEC SHIRALEE (3) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
